{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1246,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44549cabe2b0babde37a7a75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4801f31043217604704f981d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽她帮了我不少忙。\r\n学生会能顺利运作也是\r\n多亏了她的努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3e4f85644059d95c6443eb503b4c0e814ad379fc38bb1d3816441c344e07cc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cb4af4d1d1fe09a554191c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学生会经常会收到来自学生的烦恼。\r\n嗯……看来午餐又有品项缺货了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf026975a3a9dfa89920b1b60daed610325f96b2a91006cd79f20e5a5dd5ba18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0b7a353cf1dff991998cdc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵……\r\n「没姜就只好将就一下」……\r\n……呵呵呵呵……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf7b5275611b48673f1f7966d24fc5ecf287655ef8137f74d494226d8bafd9f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ac2388fb55ea4495a0606f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然想要取胜，就必须想好\r\n自己希望以什么样的方式取胜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6c4a8b8b8e9f120d845670573e21ecbc3115bc9a87cb81cbe29b11958b2f23e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bb0888750ac8fd9c1433402",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然有很多性格独特的学生，但对于\r\n赛跑大家都是很认真的。希望……\r\n她们的目标、梦想都能实现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66bf71949cbfad15479fab75a2ddd10c079405a00f46d8cc32750796f14deced",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:585bce7c7bba0d82b1f48d4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当然，胜者舞台的表现上\r\n我也是以顶点为目标的。\r\n要把最好的演唱会献给粉丝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9be8cc06481eb76f429296c818c129cb444e6942edb66b5d7bed908078b858e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f119b7b636d90ffb2fc94e1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装也是很多学生的憧憬。\r\n我会在演唱会上全力以赴，\r\n做好大家的榜样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "630dbb4567a14a64a912f8eb52a6929c07fba9fbf6f42e56b86697bb2fbfc314",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d4d3da5c11f774cd1882eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着决胜服时就会充满斗志。\r\n那就像是从「学生会长」\r\n切换成「皇帝」的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3678c67f4ae8113622000315c35a5ea681a54b0064a9372b8401b95a0592b8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84536ddbde2c22941010e951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在迈向顶点的道路上，\r\n随时都有这套决胜服的陪伴。\r\n它是我无可取代的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f79231dd6692da7f9bd45cb60195419cdb97382373c71d02292e74565ddbd80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dba6f96f942a0ded10835403",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到大家晨练时的样子，\r\n会让我也充满干劲。\r\n因此晨练是不可或缺的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8de5b9f1180e0dc46f0d051b0121166f56065dc8b7d27bf7278705fcd0c05891",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:575a26cf1460a0bbe6b93af3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟还有一群食欲旺盛的赛马娘嘛。\r\n我必须和学园商讨\r\n增加餐点份量的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5b177ae34e3598a5350f262efa4daff0357ccc6a0a847bb8b7ffb0470fbc840",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5be10765b88d25f62e61a9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天晚上我就躺在床上……\r\n好好构思我新的冷笑话好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad9dc2d2774e46792160a9e5d99f7cf3401d9865f949ef5810e01c477c8f84fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79e4e91ac314fa5b343c2003",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然春天赏花也很不错，但连续\r\n举办的ＧⅠ竞赛也不能错过。不知\r\n会诞生出怎样的巨星赛马娘呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8831136f510f5a790fbc8c2d28c137acbb54e3e80ae5b0fa593556ff50c9bb2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3bf1d7ef894a73da9c05f5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我被人说连在夏天都看起来\r\n一脸轻松……嗯，难道我该\r\n适时地表现出疲惫的样子吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8c1cdbbd6f4ea895d3ad791d82a8010710c2aee55c767d5e731cccdb455f7cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a40e173d1a9455588f2bbad3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天是学园会举办很多活动的季节。\r\n想着大家享受活动时的表情，\r\n就会让我更想为那些笑容而努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83314a481f77de1f22e9132e8a2e198da423b10ee662c13a361be430e29bf8f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ff5cf76733691c646a7cb15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然天气越来越冷，\r\n但我的斗志将燃烧不止。\r\n我是不会因为寒冷而退缩的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b258724e5ea535429afc3893dfd24dd1fb69158a19b449108b982274cb8891c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a94425357a7f80f079ebd907",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自从我留这个发型之后，\r\n帝王开心得不得了呢。\r\n下周我们还约好要去买一样的发夹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f048b3e8141045c169ba88bff6adacf4fbfc684963fe57ff0d6e61ee7d69e694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9308beb0d80a1e9aae807a1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「骏大祭」时理事长将我的任性\r\n贯彻于URA当中。\r\n我总是很感谢她呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6dfbc308827a328a0754c3ace67739ba6f26629264f7e89ce88907a3a19568f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21199f28f74947fd06503acb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "物换星移……总有一天，\r\n我也会变得跟枯叶一样腐朽凋零。\r\n必须在那一天来临前做出一番成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "334badff1cb6cc448fb9eb6d9833b8be60a62197975ec30d237269ceb6d5d88b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81cc8a6d5c6bfc2142365234",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我请真机伶教我\r\n社交平台的基本操作……\r\n但实在是……嗯，很深奥呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8545473e9b442627f76f28bac93c35b500726bf9bde041831bdc8d6082ec40a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29a077f516bdce197c72499d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然千明说我很适合扮演\r\n除魔的英雄角色……\r\n但我觉得她比较适任。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2053ac01349e1979ee3fe71c8d63abc033931a3afed39ddd46da9c421d0c576c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39e7ae62efbe0e2e7f3675c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄金城市送我的尾巴润滑油\r\n有柠檬香气呢……为早上的准备工作\r\n又增添了一点乐趣喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "981cc4acdc309ee4e3bcd5c37b51f7d88c6ef9c818b22c65fa94b636affb82c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c034ea1e100f575713729341",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上次，我去拜访以前照顾过我的\r\n弓道场，他们送了我果冻。\r\n你要不要也一起吃点心？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f2be81b179b495a45327989c5fe78706e4d63ffc59239c87d2210923cee4f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59cd384ed0060721a49e7d84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是做了恶梦就告诉我。\r\n我会为了你以弦奏乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2400705006c2fe5c156df6038bb1c569201fd7ea8d480893e148e6ac67d82291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d80d8553b0d39f89d156c9d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知道新的花苞到了秋天，\r\n会结出什么样的果……\r\n……好期待啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31f781c789860343424a366689a875a61dc8195d92f89b88a5643d0a53c2451d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1427aae750e13ebfb912ff0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我打开窗户让空气流通，\r\n白仁就嫌热。\r\n亏我还准备了团扇……真是的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79fb4d87dcba744d810e0e30229a39903ab3639cd56962c959259c77f88e9e6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a4beaaef701582ca0ca814e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能参与「骏大祭」我觉得很骄傲喔。\r\n因为这活动可能成为某些人心中的\r\n重要转机，而我有幸能贡献心力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ee3bb8a05d784bcf80fc2160be332413aecdbd517fa6ba1ac195b4b7d994ede",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f2e8425b724273a3c75a4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪祭啊……小规模的话，在这里\r\n也有可能举办吧……首先得预约卡车，\r\n以免雪不够，要运来补足……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4f20d74510338d838977b370a0590b8660da61f3623dd6ea4c94aff2271ae68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:631b1bb8c811005f3dd79782",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祖父也很喜欢这套日式服装。\r\n他说「感觉在法国也会大受欢迎」……\r\n那一天真的会到来吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "176fb08ec934dd7f8a9a52141a386147f86eb2ba9bfc07792f790ee8572130e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff1e23b40fe02f59a9096355",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情消沉时就来「赏枫」，\r\n让心情「放风」一下\r\n怎么样？……呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d498bf7655ea4216609d845282b580d6009eb7fbe99d0576ee6bf70133c4cb8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b68a67a7b4ae3a7bc9b3bac8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贯彻初衷──\r\n为我的目标进行合适的训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f356b7214a104e88eaeb5ea65a6fef442192100273a53bc6c5bca0ff1f84fb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f3b49d758c74ad406688fc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cba7776c7f432b141e5a619b9f8e42077ad110b65fd916413b0b5d7b49ddc152",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9716ca8836506bde1c84575e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在每天都该做的努力上\r\n偷懒是愚蠢的行为……\r\n我们开始训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "268dcdc00ac19afa80891367185cd89631230440e756cc66c2a9bbea4e8cea92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:212f57cd9428774e05107ebb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是基础训练也好、\r\n严苛的训练也好，\r\n都请你尽情地指导我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b99029fdb6d6c41873fe7026eb78ce68c0d48b68ecb5ebf0dfd2489f94125237",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91e1c361e1d62be0172c5695",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经准备好了，\r\n你可以随时下达指示。",
      "source_fingerprint": "094037967e79f2032543e8b66dee10e624e7d0215065f9eadd15178eb14fbe04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:049050b126aee297ab34beda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若你在指导上出现迷惘，\r\n希望你来找我商量。\r\n毕竟我们是站在相同的立场上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56a879a4720fde5723c977a96f37e77fd8e02bca73e115daad8e57850ace1c65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b02f786c09f396805edfb8d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天的训练都让我很享受……\r\n呵呵，我也很期待今天的训练内容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee700b028fc3eb6e5be66310918fe73912357c6149d2ce730f2f7087fe147729",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11d8cf84e17ae79054e28554",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你是和我有共同志向的伙伴──\r\n所以训练时我也能完全信任你……\r\n今天也拜托你了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b9d84e1d5aa323c2f71bcecfa4654cac261af1d0128aa5d1dd88aefa6b7c1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5503475691ec551d29a384bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要做什么呢？\r\n我对你的专业能力很有信心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a39c23de556c9b0f1641fc2e64ce10aabb2a50a8d06bd9d67901c5ac9c8b8da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:410a4b7db9604da9ca664f44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "腰带也重新绑好了。\r\n来，开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "841511a86cd13984256a168cbd4e691e7a80a1cd30e03c51895a82f8b08f40b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:820cc692ba30f5a8bcea3415",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了射出一发必中的箭，\r\n也得培养直觉才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99e0f360c3210e1b3055dfab29dd8ea21370b0747d4d242415572760a3d59fc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c23c5625b7d45e9bd185b03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说音乐对于提升士气有很大帮助\r\n……太鼓和笛子，\r\n你比较喜欢哪一个？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3b1b48ae743f1bb9072d33c0e56cb1dbc239a69e8fc330e13ed557fdfce051c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70f2dd1dcee74b12fe068b0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管怎么样盛装打扮，\r\n「流镝马」的本质还是狩猎。\r\n我的猎物……只属于我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4080329580f1a6ab1d2928be10471692b055ecfd47fa836b424c243e74a0fbae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7293bad6136e30654535839",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经看见自己该射中的目标。\r\n就专心致志地往目标前进吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7133c6552711767b9138927e0b9334650ea2a1d845c277f022c82e5fb24c1ee3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6543fbda26f208b64d411a95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果该处有需要攻击的对象，\r\n不管多急的陡坡都要奔驰过去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3a2a2b94aa305ad69ad9436a7a6b619ec74c719c452f2665180b4d9122aec0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9443c93ac399d42fcfa934a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……怪物这个称呼虽然代表畏惧，\r\n但也带有对优秀者的敬意。\r\n那么，训练员……你觉得我是哪种人？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d15913ee59de0fa3ae646633be8098e9ceefe0bb7ffa6fa85f7290176b3d637",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:872a39077945e5baf41fd99e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我希望今后你也能和我一起朝顶点迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0570e4f6fe7f447b3e03b4f4b7f090584e90ed5538e268f8aabbbd40cdc42815",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e02f5c4291b3b7f407966c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你这一路走来，有过许多令我惊艳的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "160256eedc66981cf2e9562886fff0a3a569432442a4956a573315b911ec7041",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35b8b95cf882cf4d72655092",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来也不要打乱呼吸，配合着奔跑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84dc758c1af466649646260e107374a72ff49b8047bc4d8b8fa18b47af13fd76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7577999f5b3200324ccd9fc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……这就是所谓的光阴似箭吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53db1ec70637fda8267f78e20b60ee50f0126417f90f7fca643b62286bcdc227",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:312056725a7ab8a34275957d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这也是勤奋努力的回报吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82d17f56a344809a1cf3fb142208ff13b4a2a21850c7d4bf128dbe97b9768a3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d98de2e29c5ac05180bef47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感觉又离「顶点」更靠近了一些。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb26d805e348afc62ff04c6687b6628b8dbec2c267ef8edb4056022a66444c2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cf447cb2d455f922acaa083",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，我是鲁道夫象征。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e86068ce82b531166ed34d538c6be9ff671a78587e853e5752a52886f810dc81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66c2820b41c409eb53a588c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让我在此展现\r\n人称「皇帝」的实力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a89eaf203f8e72038a9331213ba640c80047190a8a093e0d8edd2f7c1729834",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:531e0c0d0ea257beece8d36e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "支援就交给我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4d2801c2ace78612ca0fe8e66559099fb9874dbd2ce7d3dabf81af286862bc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e528dc31ac8ea26d23b21338",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会提供完美的支持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2489cbf9ad42d9256365f5706b362c654b3a961522ea8627de58a078902470c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46058ef2f7c6f4032bf834d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很期待可以展现技巧的那天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37e8feb9ccf89642b91985d8ecb13cbc08f70b0d3d0a1298a0ab39ae3527ef5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8280043bf09f930e3fc6476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "萌芽的意志……是热情还是本能？",
      "source_fingerprint": "255910b72540af07c7ac0a81bb3aa331d50d8481e473d050bed67bb512b98d27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a343d1025acb2c6202083a0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桃弧棘矢──就用我的弓箭\r\n驱走所有灾厄吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a571c9240540ae5677b6933d5f3752791e1753ab997091c3c7bf3a86b83ee35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d8c18f1a5b0377d68b09ebd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征，准备登场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85bffa3cd071498b392f7e95b71bbd8774cc703ba42617a539feb6012b82e713",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f28b5c1c114ec8e3aae5b79c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打起精神迎战吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a0e7ce630ad5f0dd10873407fba8c959835a6b581c2fa7f9932273c5313ec8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6f5a1dae7976ec991620f1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我虽说过「可以信任你」，\r\n但又没说「已经信任你」了。\r\n……呵，再继续努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "523ddc3b4cda5e3de16e2627ae001bfd362e6ee6db42b569d82ae52cdfdcba3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bcac7b9a4af1b9e13bf1bbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1165a572af66e3de74188d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰ったぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29ad959e7d38bf0879fa29694e9dfb266be6347e47e6b87a96796c63131331ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd5c2be6745f6051def2f0d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天早上到校舍后方来。\r\n……差不多到了要开花的时候了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf7eaa8257a11bcfd9c1c6212138718839a41eebb61abebcb653d26d0912d032",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a7582a117dc62f571e4049a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你说过我是「理想中的女帝」……\r\n放心吧，我不会让这理想崩坏的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7a950af967763945581bbd871c1313bdcacf7933fd345e3a3841be36c167ce6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73f51614ae43983901ecae70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n过年也不要过度松懈怠慢，\r\n一定要过规律的生活。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d6a8a8339eac7aec3c10f4b0fca3c2ac9e65244b811a7bb8f2dc2749c4500a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56e34a49450d28c4ab2eb291",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎……受人憧憬虽让我心生感激，\r\n但那么多的巧克力实在让人头痛。\r\n得想想要怎么吃完呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4976a9529eac41f5f861b8401b1ea156e3b5c68f0889a2ff6a0e2ad999eff934",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a0b8a8dfee00583ab8d7bb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我准备了巧克力。\r\n这仅代表我认同你平时的努力……\r\n吃完的感想要直接告诉我，以上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aff12d3ba0d9d07e33f29e9da7e1c5718cd853e0e2073b0f2560e3b0d92d481",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e05b90c766ec3543610fe6f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竹子上挂满了签纸。\r\n这样就让我想要祈祷\r\n这些愿望都能实现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "103eafb5f52ead728ae1eeb8b0b42653174638a02f5eb99f4565ab3f92c7a0c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db75f0f8b76e141e60308c3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋。母亲曾经交待我\r\n「要重视每个季节的活动」，所以你\r\n也好好享受吧……但要适可而止啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c34f3147f6e5ff5bc57ac92e3db5d8ebf7c21b351dcd21bb6d878e8b04dfa9b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c875e0fcda1b0d4fe448cd06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年只要摆出大圣诞树，\r\n就一定会有人想爬上去……\r\n哎……今年爬树的会是谁呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e570877e920650211374f3057f5ac7f8fb9922b11c4c8988c5266794ebd23067",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8649ac20d24321e1f4cfdcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "街上的灯海很值得一看。\r\n你如果想看的话，\r\n我也不是不能陪你去哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6639c37843bdadcb4190a8e43c665617cb3a670e891c02a94a4a1ef546322ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3c61f56ff06fee1e1533fff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好，我赢了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a3aa286ceb30afc2547094dc1d0a9854e0a3c2c5f175612d9bf2c87eb315b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6c1e91786eb8fbf91ace1c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "转眼已经年底了……因为有你\r\n每天啰嗦，才没有特别无聊……\r\n我这是在讽刺你，你有听懂吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "41fadd26c4bb9fc17d263c75ff88aca894df691466c763059e1325f79c56e3dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e66dcdb7556ff8f20bc7999c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么？今天是你生日？\r\n……这种事情要提早讲啊。\r\n这不就害我无法事前准备吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "73bcd753b337d34ae226e3592e3d52d2cce9221800e1999c401a49d745d72612",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a4119937fc9f4477f4080bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，你有什么心愿吗？\r\n……毕竟今天是你生日嘛。\r\n也不是不能帮你实现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bcbe4463ac10b97ba358a533ea8d372a7e4de036549f6e2984c897e8c76210f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e75b987e6921bc4f8549feb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我要提早走。\r\n因为我母亲为了庆祝我的生日\r\n要来见我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc1d899cd374f56068a1101572821e47d32f6c2586ac2ae8246897af25aa6939",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84a62fddb84ae5689031186a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要帮我庆生？……咳、咳。\r\n虽然我很忙……但拿你没办法。\r\n等着吧，我现在就空出时间来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe319eac47839df154ee918c60c53f2f1d69f9a2da308610c17daf27a4a16cfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "10014"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
